sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Provider codec
    participant R as Router and assembler
    participant H as Session store
    participant B as Tool broker
    P->>R: Bound attempt events and complete tool observations
    R->>R: Validate identity, ordinals and native continuation
    Note over P,R: Incomplete stream retains evidence, tools stay unready
    P->>R: Valid terminal tool-call turn
    R->>H: Atomic batch of native items and complete calls
    H-->>R: Durable sequence and batch receipt
    R->>B: Admit calls under current authority and root controls
    par Independent call A
        B->>H: Save completed response A
    and Call B needs approval
        B->>H: Save initial ApprovalRequired response B
    end
    R->>H: Read durable responses by original call ordinal
    H-->>R: Ordered results and retained native items
    R->>P: Provider-valid continuation with current context
    Note over B,H: Later approval resumes saved operation through fresh admission
    B->>H: Append later operation outcome as a new event
    Note over P,H: No second result for the old native call ID
    R->>H: Explicit epoch change for provider switch or compaction
    Note over R,H: Preserve history and exclude incompatible opaque state
